20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"海もお祭りも 楽しいですが…。やっぱりその分、 日常に戻ったときに 苦しいですよね…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"えへへ、あちこち、 楽しそうな人が たくさんいますね…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"海…お祭り…もしかしたら今が 私の人生の最高潮かも しれません…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"いろんな意味で初めて 経験することばかりです…海のお祭りって 元々こういう ものなんですか…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLogin_Season_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"さ、最後まで 楽しんでおかないと、もったいなくて 眠れないかも しれませんよ…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLogin_Season_End_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"終わりました… 終わってしまいましたね…もう私の人生にこんな日は こないでしょうね…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLogin_Season_End_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventLogin_Season_End_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"え？また海に連れてきて くださるんですか？えへへ、 ありがとうございます。じゃあ次は リゾートホテルとかに…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventLogin_Season_End_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"わ、私は何がいいものなのか よくわからないので…先生が選んだほうがいいと 思いますけど…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ひ、ひええっ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_Buy_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"そ、そんなものも あったんですね…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_Buy_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_Buy_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"高いものをそんな簡単に… 大人ってすごいですね…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_Buy_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_Buy_3","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"もしかして私への プレゼントですか……？もしそうでしたら、 ありがとうございます。えヘヘ…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_Buy_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_Buy_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"あ、それ、私も目を つけていたものです。えへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_Buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_End","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ショップが 終わってしまいましたね。私は買えませんでしたが、 見ているのは楽しかったです…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_Login_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"えへへ、ここはいろいろ 売ってますね。買っていただけるなら 断りはしません、えヘヘ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_EventShop_Login_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_EventShop_Login_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"良さそうなものが