_In_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"は、はい……！準備はできましたけど……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Formation_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"え、えへへ……私が出ないとですね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Formation_Select.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"え、えへへ、結局来てしまいました……！夏、海……幸せです……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"わ、私にくださるんですか……？勘違いじゃないですよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"私に任せたい仕事があるんですね……えへへ、やっぱりそうですよね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"えへへ、ありがとうございます……こういうのもいいですが、 やっぱりかき氷の方がもっと元気が出そうです……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"い、いつもより楽しくて、なんだか慣れないです……。 夏だからでしょうか……？それとも先生がいるから……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"え、えへへ、 失礼にならないのであれば、 アイスを一つだけ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"えっ！「ヒヨリが食べると 思って買っておいた」……？  ありがとうございます！ さすが先生です……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"シャーレに置いてある 雑誌も先々月のもの……！  やっぱり人生は 辛いものなんですね……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"え、えへへ、絶望的な 事実を一つ教えますね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"冷蔵庫の氷が 底をつきました……。  やっぱり人生って 辛いものなんですね…… 夏だとなおさらです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"えへへ……は、はい？ これですか？えっと、海で一緒に 撮った写真ですけど……  先生も見ますか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"えへへ、 スイーツがいっぱい……。 次はスクワッドのみんなを 連れてきてもいいでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あ、せ、先生？ 今日は、水遊び しないんですか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"えヘヘ…… 今日は当番なんです…… お世話になります……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_LogIn_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"いたたた…… 痛いですぅぅ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ひえっ！？ 私のアイスバーが？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"終わりです！もう終わりです！ 一口しか食べてないのに 砂だらけになって しまうなんて……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"やっぱり私にはアイスバーさえも 許されないんですね……！ 完全に見放されました……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私の人生はどうしてこんなに 苦難に満ちているのでしょうか？  他の人は夏を楽しんで いるというのに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"んなに頑張っても、 私にとっては届かない 夢のようなものだなんて……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……え？もう一つ 買ってくださるんですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"それって……落とした アイスバーが無事だったら 2倍食べられたって ことですよね……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"うわぁん！ やっぱり終わりです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"わ、私を信じてくださるんですか……？本当に……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"そ、そんなに褒められても……私があげられるものはないですが…… ま、まさか私の水着を狙って！？……ち、違うんですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"えっと、先生、焼きそばは好きですか……？ 一緒に食べに行きませんか？ えへへ、すみません、お会計はお願いします……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生に出会ってから少しはマシになりましたが……。 それでも人生は辛いものなんですね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私の誕生日…… 特に興味はないですが……  でも、先生のお言葉のおかげで、 少し特別な日になって しまいましたね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_Birthday.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お誕生日 おめでとうございます……！  苦しい人生が始まった日ですが、 たまには楽しんでみるのも いいですよね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あ、飴は持って ないんですけど……か、代わりに いたずらをどうぞ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_Halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"はい？先生が 私にくださるんですか？  え、えへへ、 では、ありがたくいただきます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_Halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"明けましておめでとう ございます……今年も 苦しいことが多いと思いますが、 生き続けないとですよね……。  えへへ、 今年もよろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_NewYear.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"く、クリスマスプレゼントです……！ つまらないものですが、 この下のコンビニで買いました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_Xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"その、う、受け取って いただければ…… と思いますけど。えへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Season_Xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"終わりです！完全に終わりです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"私たちは、これからどうなってしまうのでしょうか…きっと、大変なことになりますよね！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"やっぱり、人生は辛いものなんですね...","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0269_Tactic_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0269_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"こ、ここまで来て戦闘だなんて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%